            <p>Donning Personal Protective Equipment. The illustrated image depicts the structured process that includes hand hygiene, gowns, masks or respirators, eye protection, and gloves.&#x000a0;Each step minimizes contamination risks, providing maximum protection, which is crucial for safety. Centers for Disease Control and Prevention</p>
          </caption>
          <graphic xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" xlink:href="Isolation-Donning-PPE-CDC" position="float" orientation="portrait"/>
